      "background": "A pipeline change set payments max_transfer_minor from 1000000 to 1, so payments rejected nearly all transfers. Separately, the reconciliation batch held a write lock on the ledger, the screening primary went down (exit code 15), and ops-maintenance raised gateway balance_cache_ttl_s from 0.5 to 600.",
